Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.44,0:00:07.57,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:18.59,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.63,0:00:23.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.30,0:00:27.10,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:34.74,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.41,0:00:41.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:49.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.26,0:00:55.39,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:59.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.27,0:01:03.73,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.27,0:01:10.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:21.52,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.19,0:01:39.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很近了 就在森林那一带
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:45.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尾随着四魂碎片的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.63,0:01:49.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巧遇遭到 奈落的妖怪袭击的琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.50,0:01:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落驱使妖怪取回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.94,0:01:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埋藏在琥珀体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.78,0:02:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喜于和琥珀重逢的珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是琥珀已被奈落消除记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.89,0:02:13.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法想起珊瑚的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:16.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.73,0:02:19.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从奈落的手里逃出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真希望是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.27,0:02:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是奈落的陷阱不会错的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就是想要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在的我除了相信还能怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.05,0:02:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,率领大群妖怪的神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.59,0:02:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现在我们面前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:42.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要取回埋藏在 琥珀体内的四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若四魂碎片被取走
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀就会没命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.16,0:02:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了保护琥珀免遭那些家伙的毒手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:50.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉一行人阻止了妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我则和琥珀一起逃入森林中
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.07,0:03:04.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能想起那个人的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.51,0:03:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是怎么搞的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.71,0:03:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种感觉…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:13.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么可怕的东西 我非想起来不可
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.09,0:03:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她 杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.70,0:03:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破魔之矢用光了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.84,0:03:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.08,0:03:40.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第50话 那张脸绝不会自心底消失
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:43.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.83,0:03:58.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会再把你交给奈落的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.48,0:04:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.41,0:04:10.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你听好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要尽可能牵制神乐她们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.24,0:04:36.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.87,0:04:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:39.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了抓个逃走的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:43.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带了这样一大群来 这样刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:44.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:47.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们全被奈落的把戏唬住了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.69,0:04:50.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好演吧 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:53.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里碰见真是百年难得
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.19,0:04:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就顺便杀光你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:58.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的头我要定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.92,0:05:27.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.30,0:05:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:36.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和刚才琥珀完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:49.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀啊 杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.68,0:05:51.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.60,0:06:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.41,0:06:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:20.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了她
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.12,0:06:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.00,0:06:38.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 这点伤没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:06:59.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.65,0:07:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 跟在戈薇身边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.95,0:07:03.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 很痛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:19.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道珊瑚她…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没完没了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风刃之舞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:38.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不拔刀啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付你们不需要用铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:54.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你还没熟悉刀的用法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.14,0:07:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以就使用爪子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头脑真好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.14,0:08:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:02.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样就用砍的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀法变的这么迟钝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.00,0:08:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…还是重的无法随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.01,0:08:36.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了牵制这群妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须让它们以为
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀似乎还在这间屋子里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:06.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.68,0:09:08.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还敢看别的地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来屋子里是空的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.85,0:09:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是为了巧妙的拖住我们
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.89,0:09:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.12,0:09:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没跟我一决胜负呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:00.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要被骗了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:07.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐也好 这些妖怪也好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.47,0:10:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目的应该是琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.11,0:10:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们连一个人 都没有追过去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.11,0:10:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果她们打算将我们困住
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.15,0:10:20.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许被困住的反而是我们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.05,0:10:24.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果奈落真正的目的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.02,0:10:26.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是琥珀的话呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.69,0:10:27.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她追着琥珀进入森林中…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.63,0:10:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然琥珀也是奈落的手下吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在才注意到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.34,0:10:41.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过已经来不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:42.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:45.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然利用琥珀对戈薇下手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.64,0:10:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.78,0:10:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个使用破魔之箭 叫做戈薇的女人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.51,0:10:50.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常碍事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:59.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有毒虫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.84,0:11:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别乱来啊 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.38,0:11:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.82,0:11:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连毒蜂也吸进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你去追珊瑚还有戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:40.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 弥勒 你别死喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想逃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要动 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要转个方向
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:45.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能连你也吸进来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.34,0:11:50.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恕不奉陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.75,0:11:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃掉了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.39,0:12:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.59,0:12:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也快点去追犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.24,0:12:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小鬼竟然装出
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连虫也舍不得杀的模样来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:03.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.15,0:13:13.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然还没 从奈落手里解放出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是为了伤害戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:18.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夺取四魂碎片而来的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.23,0:13:22.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其让你继续受到奈落的利用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我宁可…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.60,0:13:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 我马上就让你自由
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.23,0:13:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:50.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你一个人走的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快就会去陪你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.70,0:13:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:09.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 快点去追珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.42,0:14:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你被琥珀弄伤了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.22,0:14:18.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,皮肉伤而已 而且那孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.92,0:14:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他想杀我一定做得到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.63,0:14:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他却没那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.36,0:14:27.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚她不知道这些事情
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.50,0:14:33.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也许打算把琥珀杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.57,0:14:35.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:44.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀没有一击让戈薇致命
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么没有遵从奈落的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:49.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.55,0:14:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使被操纵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:56.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀还残留着人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.18,0:15:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得不太好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好害羞的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.36,0:15:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是姐弟呀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.49,0:15:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 不要再离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.63,0:15:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你是我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:46.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是我唯一的亲弟弟啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了你之后我也会自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.71,0:15:54.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了把你从奈落手里夺回
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.10,0:16:12.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了你之后我也会自杀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了把你从奈落手里夺回
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:18.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.84,0:16:21.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.25,0:16:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:57.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别阻止我 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.51,0:16:58.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.55,0:17:00.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了琥珀的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会让奈落称心如意
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你也是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.06,0:17:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不给我醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.91,0:17:30.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如同命令所说…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫琥珀杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀绝对不会违抗奈落的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.09,0:17:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想为什么琥珀会丧失记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:46.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是奈落操纵了他的心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说也对 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.10,0:17:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀自己也不愿想起往事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:56.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不愿想起的记忆…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.05,0:18:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.39,0:18:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在琥珀面前不要再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:18.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混帐神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本人都想忘记的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.90,0:18:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落就让他忘得一干二净
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:28.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要操纵琥珀纯洁的心
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.64,0:18:31.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对奈落而言是易如反掌
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀！想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.68,0:18:40.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.98,0:18:42.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚和驱魔师的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:46.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部都给我想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.16,0:18:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你还想活下去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:51.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.50,0:18:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不能想起来并面对它的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的心就永远受奈落的控制
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.97,0:18:59.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.27,0:19:01.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,藏在体内的四魂碎片会被取走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会被那家伙给杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:11.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得还真狠呢 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.36,0:19:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站住 神乐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:24.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是想起自己做过什么的话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这小子…真的会彻底崩溃的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.00,0:19:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他忘了一切的死去 也是为了他好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这下又…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.56,0:20:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.30,0:20:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下又回到起点了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是找麻烦的姐弟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.81,0:20:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早告诉你不要那么冲动啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:18.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:20.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确命令琥珀杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.32,0:20:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是琥珀却没有杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:27.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他还残存着人类的心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:31.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你不能杀琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.04,0:20:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要把他活生生的抢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.72,0:20:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经把你的性命延长
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:21:00.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至让你忘记一切
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.40,0:21:04.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然没有杀了戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:08.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在你还想取回人类的心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.01,0:21:19.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:23.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,将一切都回想起来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要 我不要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.76,0:21:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就暂时再让你活一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.77,0:21:44.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把一切都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.05,0:21:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 那个人的脸…无法消失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:30.47,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.88,0:22:41.99,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.06,0:22:49.49,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:53.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.27,0:22:57.96,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.01,0:23:04.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:12.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.92,0:23:19.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.43,0:23:27.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:35.04,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:49.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子遭到盗贼的袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.97,0:23:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暴虐无道的盗贼首领 蛾天丸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.11,0:23:55.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是化成人形的蛾妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.01,0:23:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉和弥勒法师一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.95,0:23:59.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被困在毒茧当中了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.75,0:24:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同一时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.65,0:24:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,寻找犬夜叉妖化之谜的杀生丸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.35,0:24:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然从老木妖怪那里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.72,0:24:07.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得知一个恐怖的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.86,0:24:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.53,0:24:13.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的心被吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.36,0:24:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
